[statement]
A package removed waits for the packages needing it to change: `oldlib`,
which `app` 1.0 needed, is removed right after `app` is upgraded, before
`zz` is installed; `orph`, which nothing needed, goes first.

[repository]
P:app
V:2.0-r0
D:newlib

P:newlib
V:1

P:oldlib
V:1

P:zz
V:1

P:aa
V:1

[installed]
P:oldlib
V:1

P:app
V:1.0-r0
D:oldlib

P:orph
V:1

[world]
app

[request]
app>=2
aa
zz

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
remove orph 1
install aa 1
install newlib 1
upgrade app 1.0-r0 2.0-r0
remove oldlib 1
install zz 1
